@startuml
!include common-theme.puml
title 策略模式：推荐引擎组合多种打分算法

interface ScoreStrategy {
  +score(context, activity): int
}

class InterestMatchStrategy
class HotScoreStrategy
class TimeProximityStrategy
class CollegeRelatedStrategy
class ConflictPenaltyStrategy

class RecommendationEngine {
  +rank(activities, context)
}

ScoreStrategy <|.. InterestMatchStrategy
ScoreStrategy <|.. HotScoreStrategy
ScoreStrategy <|.. TimeProximityStrategy
ScoreStrategy <|.. CollegeRelatedStrategy
ScoreStrategy <|.. ConflictPenaltyStrategy

RecommendationEngine o--> "1..*" ScoreStrategy : 组合调用

note right of RecommendationEngine
总分 = 兴趣匹配 + 热度 + 时间临近
      + 学院相关 - 冲突惩罚
end note
@enduml
